Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [seeed R2000 board specific]

reComputer R2x (R2000) wires the LoRa concentrator to SPI2 (/dev/spidev2.0,
the upstream default is spidev0.0 which does not exist on this machine) and
the concentrator module I2C bus is /dev/i2c-2. Adjust the compiled-in paths
of chip_id/spectral_scan, the packet_forwarder global_conf files and the
loragw_i2c.h device accordingly.

diff --git a/libloragw/inc/loragw_i2c.h b/libloragw/inc/loragw_i2c.h
index a35b772..240d3f1 100644
--- a/libloragw/inc/loragw_i2c.h
+++ b/libloragw/inc/loragw_i2c.h
@@ -29,7 +29,7 @@ License: Revised BSD License, see LICENSE.TXT file include in the project
 #define LGW_I2C_SUCCESS     0
 #define LGW_I2C_ERROR       -1
 
-#define I2C_DEVICE          "/dev/i2c-1"
+#define I2C_DEVICE          "/dev/i2c-2"
 
 /* -------------------------------------------------------------------------- */
 /* --- PUBLIC FUNCTIONS PROTOTYPES ------------------------------------------ */
